WEBVTT

00:09:59.306 --> 00:10:00.924
I sometimes didn't shave.

00:10:00.948 --> 00:10:02.483
It was dreadful.

00:10:02.507 --> 00:10:04.976
And it was clear -- not to me,

00:10:05.000 --> 00:10:08.430
because nothing was clear
to me at that time anymore --

00:10:08.454 --> 00:10:11.439
that I would need
long-term hospitalization

00:10:12.431 --> 00:10:16.186
in that awful place
called a "mental hospital."

00:10:16.210 --> 00:10:21.976
So I was admitted, in the spring of 1973,

00:10:22.000 --> 00:10:25.538
to the Institute of Living, which used
to be called the Hartford Retreat.

00:10:25.562 --> 00:10:27.276
It was founded in the 18th century,

00:10:27.300 --> 00:10:31.669
the largest psychiatric hospital
in the state of Connecticut,